{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martinring/tmlanguage/master/tmlanguage.json",
  "name": "FSL",
  "scopeName": "source.fsl",
  "comment": "Regex-based highlighting is approximate because FSL keywords are contextual. The FSL 5 keywords (fsl5-declarations, fsl5-keywords) are derived from rust/fsl-syntax/src/keywords.rs and apply only after an `fsl 5` header line; rust/fsl-syntax/tests/vscode_grammar_keywords.rs keeps them in step.",
  "patterns": [
    { "include": "#fsl5-document" },
    { "include": "#edition-header" },
    { "include": "#comments" },
    { "include": "#strings" },
    { "include": "#declarations" },
    { "include": "#builtins" },
    { "include": "#keywords" },
    { "include": "#constants" },
    { "include": "#numbers" },
    { "include": "#operators" },
    { "include": "#methods" }
  ],
  "repository": {
    "edition-header": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "meta.edition-header.fsl",
          "match": "^\\x{FEFF}?[ \\t]*(fsl)[ \\t]+([45])[ \\t]*$",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.other.edition.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "constant.numeric.edition.fsl" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "fsl5-document": {
      "comment": "An `fsl 5` header opens the rest of the document: the FSL 4 rules plus the FSL 5 keywords. A headerless or `fsl 4` document never enters it. The end never matches.",
      "begin": "^\\x{FEFF}?[ \\t]*(fsl)[ \\t]+(5)[ \\t]*$",
      "beginCaptures": {
        "0": { "name": "meta.edition-header.fsl" },
        "1": { "name": "keyword.other.edition.fsl" },
        "2": { "name": "constant.numeric.edition.fsl" }
      },
      "end": "(?!)",
      "patterns": [
        { "include": "#comments" },
        { "include": "#strings" },
        { "include": "#declarations" },
        { "include": "#fsl5-declarations" },
        { "include": "#builtins" },
        { "include": "#keywords" },
        { "include": "#fsl5-keywords" },
        { "include": "#constants" },
        { "include": "#numbers" },
        { "include": "#operators" },
        { "include": "#methods" }
      ]
    },
    "fsl5-declarations": {
      "comment": "FSL 5 declaration heads followed by the declared name: keywords.rs rows of context Declaration (and Requirements). A Japanese head is a whole identifier: no identifier character may stand directly before it.",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "meta.definition.block.fsl",
          "match": "(?<![\\p{XID_Continue}])(要件)\\s+([\\p{XID_Continue}&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]][[\\p{XID_Continue}-]&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]]*)",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "entity.name.type.fsl" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "meta.definition.named.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(forbidden|resource|scenario|concept|measure|decide|entity|number|policy|actor|const|event|enum|goal|rule|type|kpi)\\s+([\\p{XID_Continue}&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]][[\\p{XID_Continue}-]&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]]*)",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "entity.name.function.fsl" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "meta.definition.named.fsl",
          "match": "(?<![\\p{XID_Continue}])(エンティティ|拒否シナリオ|アクター|シナリオ|重要指標|出来事|決定表|列挙|区分|定数|指標|数値|方針|目標|規則|資源|型)\\s+([\\p{XID_Continue}&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]][[\\p{XID_Continue}-]&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]]*)",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "entity.name.function.fsl" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "fsl5-keywords": {
      "comment": "Every active keywords.rs row in English and Japanese, and the particles. Declaration-head rows (contexts Document and Declaration) are keyword.declaration; the rest are keyword.control. A multi-word English keyword matches as one phrase. A Japanese keyword or particle matches only as a whole identifier (no identifier character on either side), so the particles never match inside a name.",
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(requirements|forbidden|glossary|resource|scenario|concept|measure|decide|entity|number|policy|verify|actor|const|event|enum|goal|rule|type|kpi)\\b"
        },
        {
          "name": "keyword.control.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(must\\s+eventually\\s+be|belongs\\s+to|only\\s+after|can\\s+reach|instances|lifecycle|only\\s+from|only\\s+when|otherwise|assuming|deadline|only\\s+for|rejected|always|covers|enters|not\\s+in|values|allow|count|every|fault|input|never|where|some|then|when|with|and|for|has|set|via|as|in|is|or)\\b"
        },
        {
          "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl",
          "match": "(?<![\\p{XID_Continue}])(エンティティ|拒否シナリオ|アクター|シナリオ|重要指標|出来事|決定表|用語集|列挙|区分|定数|指標|数値|方針|検証|目標|要件|規則|資源|型)(?![\\p{XID_Continue}])"
        },
        {
          "name": "keyword.control.fsl",
          "match": "(?<![\\p{XID_Continue}])(ライフサイクル|いずれかの|いずれ必ず|すべての|それ以外|先行条件|到達可能|対応要件|段階以外|のうち|または|所属先|遷移元|遷移先|かつ|仮定|件数|個数|値域|入力|契機|対象|常に|役名|必須|拒否|更新|期限|条件|段階|異常|禁止|結果|許可)(?![\\p{XID_Continue}])"
        },
        {
          "name": "keyword.other.particle.fsl",
          "match": "(?<![\\p{XID_Continue}])(が|で|に|は|を)(?![\\p{XID_Continue}])"
        }
      ]
    },
    "comments": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "comment.line.double-slash.fsl",
          "match": "//.*$"
        }
      ]
    },
    "strings": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "string.quoted.double.fsl",
          "match": "\"[^\"]*\""
        }
      ]
    },
    "declarations": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "meta.definition.block.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(spec|compose|requirements|business|governance|refinement)\\s+([_\\p{XID_Start}][\\p{XID_Continue}&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]]*)",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "entity.name.type.fsl" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "meta.definition.named.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(const|type|enum|struct|entity|number|action|invariant|trans|reachable|leadsTo|until|unless|requirement|acceptance|forbidden|kpi|process|control|policy|goal|authority|preservation)\\s+([\\p{XID_Continue}&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]][[\\p{XID_Continue}-]&&[^\\x{30FB}\\x{FF65}]]*)",
          "captures": {
            "1": { "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl" },
            "2": { "name": "entity.name.function.fsl" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "builtins": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "support.type.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(Int|Bool|Map|Set|Seq|Option)\\b"
        },
        {
          "name": "support.function.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(stage|count|sum|min|max|abs|old|unique|exactlyOne|some)\\b(?=\\s*\\()"
        }
      ]
    },
    "keywords": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "keyword.control.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(if|else|forall|exists|where|in|and|or|not|is|within|decreases|then|every|must|eventually|be|can|reach|all|while|when|with|by|from|as|of)\\b"
        },
        {
          "name": "keyword.declaration.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(verify|instances|values|use|internal|state|init|fair|requires|ensures|let|symmetric|impl|abs|maps|auto|map|stutter|preserve|progress|respond|implements|branches|expect|rejected|time|urgent|age|deadline|actor|stages|initial|transition|set|covers|owner|severity|applies_to|satisfies|delegates|require|satisfied_by|before|after|checked_by|owns)\\b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "constants": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "constant.language.fsl",
          "match": "\\b(true|false|none)\\b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "numbers": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "constant.numeric.integer.fsl",
          "match": "\\b[0-9]+\\b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "operators": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "keyword.operator.fsl",
          "match": "=>|~>|\\|\\||==|!=|<=|>=|\\.\\.|[+\\-*/%<>=]"
        }
      ]
    },
    "methods": {
      "patterns": [
        {
          "name": "support.function.method.fsl",
          "match": "\\.(contains|add|remove|push|pop|head|at|size)\\b"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
